Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2026 21:45:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 26.3 API adaptations

26.2 dropped several access transformers that Leaves relied on. This patch
re-widens those vanilla field declarations (Leaves' AT mechanism). The
mechanical EntityType->EntityTypes / knockback / login-packet adaptations that
used to live here have been folded back into their owning feature patches.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
index 37dd6edd396a32e622d60aa3cbd73168662d395d..a757b9cdf4009e9a450aa588d7192a6232da2556 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
@@ -1212,7 +1212,7 @@ public class ChunkMap extends SimpleRegionStorage implements ChunkHolder.PlayerP
         return this.entityMap.containsKey(id);
     }
 
-    protected void addEntity(final Entity entity) {
+    public void addEntity(final Entity entity) { // Leaves - 26.2 dropped AT
         org.spigotmc.AsyncCatcher.catchOp("entity track"); // Spigot
         // Paper start - ignore and warn about illegal addEntity calls instead of crashing server
         if (!entity.valid || entity.level() != this.level || this.entityMap.containsKey(entity.getId())) {
